;   Title init clears through lastz ($0742). These three bytes are the
;   `jsr initdma` at dotitle ($8040, slot 0). They now call `inspclr`,
;   which zeros the inspect slack and jumps to initdma, so initdma's
;   rts still reaches the `jsr initcols` that follows.
;
;   Written by us. Eurocom's source is read-only and pinned; see README.md.

        org $8040
insptitl jsr inspclr
